@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: OSB Marketing Events
	Frontend testing for creating an osb marketing event

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I sign out and sign into www as a user with the email address "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" and password "test"
	* I tear down the following marketing events
	| Test Community Event |

Scenario: Add Marketing Event
	Admins should be able to add a marketing event on www.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the account sign in link on the Sign In tab dropdown
	And I sign into www as a user with the email address "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" and password "test"
	And I navigate to the Product Menu and go to the "OSB Marketing Events Admin" portlet under the "Content & Data" category under the "Site Administration" panel
	And I click the add event button
	And I populate the following marketing events fields and values
	| Type                     | Community                                              |
	| Title                    | Test Community Event                                   |
	| Body                     | Please join us for our latest community event          |
	| Title URL                | https://www.testcommunityevent.com                     |
	| Hosted By                | Liferay                                                |
	| Hosted By URL            | https://www.liferay.com/                               |
	| Image                    | PRODUCT,DIGITAL EXPERIENCE PLATFORM,01-hello-world.jpg |
	| Street 1                 | 1400 Montefino Avenue                                  |
	| City                     | Diamond Bar                                            |
	| Zip                      | 91765                                                  |
	| Country                  | united-states                                          |
	| Global Region            | Americas                                               |
	| Registration URL         | https://www.liferay.com/                               |
	| Extra Settings           | Some extra settings for this event                     |
	| Marketing Event Campaign | 7.1 Launch - US                                        |
	| Topic                    | Customer Experience                                    |
	And I click the marketing events save button
	And I navigate to the Product Menu and go to the "OSB Marketing Events Admin" portlet under the "Content & Data" category under the "Site Administration" panel
	Then I should be able to view the marketing event with the title "Test Community Event" and the following values
	| Type          | Community            |
	| Title         | Test Community Event |
	| Global Region | Americas             |